WEBVTT

00:04:29.087 --> 00:04:32.212
because the [1,000] women
blowing up social media right now

00:04:32.236 --> 00:04:37.603
have already inspired
over 100,000 women to walk.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:43.304
(Applause)

00:04:44.282 --> 00:04:46.000
But that is not nearly enough.

00:04:46.766 --> 00:04:50.580
And so our goal
is to create critical mass.

00:04:51.341 --> 00:04:52.611
And in order to do that,

00:04:52.635 --> 00:04:56.975
we have an audacious plan
to scale our intervention.

00:04:57.646 --> 00:04:59.644
A thousand organizers is not enough.